# Phase 3 — Proper policy SDK

Right now policies are Python classes.

Formalize the interface.

```text
robobladez-sdk/
```

Core contract:

```python
class RoboBladePolicy:
    def initialize(self, match_context):
        ...

    def act(self, observation):
        return Action(...)

    def round_end(self, result):
        ...

    def match_end(self, result):
        ...
```

Observation should include only legal information.

Example:

```json
{
  "time": 4.22,

  "self": {
    "position": [0.12, -0.06],
    "velocity": [0.3, 0.1],
    "spin": 488,
    "energy": 72
  },

  "opponent": {
    "position": [-0.08, 0.14],
    "velocity": [-0.2, 0.4],
    "spin": 431
  },

  "round": 3,

  "history": {
    "previous_round_winners": [
      "boris",
      "morty"
    ]
  }
}
```

Action:

```json
{
  "radial": 0.4,
  "tangential": -0.3,
  "torque": 0.2,
  "boost": 0.6
}
```

Version the SDK.

```text
rbz-policy-api-v1
```

