# Phase 7 — PSRO / meta evolution

This is where it gets serious.

Use OpenSpiel concepts:

[https://github.com/google-deepmind/open_spiel](https://github.com/google-deepmind/open_spiel)

Maintain a population:

```text
Boris-v3
Boris-v5
Boris-v8
Morty-v4
Alice-v6
...
```

Build payoff matrix.

```text
            B3   B5   M4   A6
B3           -   .4   .7   .2
B5          .6    -   .5   .8
M4          .3   .5    -   .7
A6          .8   .2   .3    -
```

Then:

```text
new policy
=
best response to current meta
```

That gives actual evolutionary pressure.

### Exit condition

The league develops:

```text
meta
counter-meta
counter-counter-meta
```

without you scripting it.

