Only now.

Do not assign daimons manually as gameplay truth.

Maintain long-term phenotype:

```text
aggression
patience
mobility
risk
adaptability
counter tendency
center control
resource efficiency
unpredictability
```

EWMA over matches.

Then project:

```text
Earth
Water
Fire
Air
Aether
```

Example:

```text
BORIS after 70 matches

water   .48
earth   .31
air     .13
fire    .06
aether  .02
```

At stability threshold:

```text
manifestation event
```

The system can say:

> Boris's daimon has stabilized.

Then naming occurs.

Possible mechanism:

```text
behavior phenotype
+
agent history
+
visual seed
+
LLM naming
=
Penelope
```

Crucially:

```text
Penelope reflects Boris.
Penelope does not secretly determine Boris.
```

unless you later deliberately promote abilities into a ruleset.

