# Phase 9 — Signature move discovery

Store windows around decisive events.

Feature vector:

```text
relative position
relative velocity
spin states
action history
energy state
opponent action
outcome delta
```

Cluster recurring successful sequences.

Example:

```text
Boris repeatedly:

allows approach
→ lateral orbit
→ opponent overshoots center
→ Boris counter-contacts
→ opponent exits rim
```

After sufficient support:

```text
SIGNATURE_PATTERN_014
confidence=.82
matches=31
```

Then narrative engine names it:

```text
Slipstream
```

Then visual system gets a signature grammar.

That is real emergent lore.

