# The order I would actually execute

Do these in this exact order:

```text
1. 10–12 policies
2. 8 body archetypes
3. 100k matchup experiment
4. tune game until counters emerge
5. mechanical baseline reports
6. policy SDK
7. sandbox
8. league DB
9. persistent agent versions
10. opponent modelling
11. evolutionary policy search
12. PSRO/meta analysis
13. phenotype history
14. daimon emergence
15. signature detection
16. canon/narrative detectors
17. episode compiler
18. canonical visual assets
19. LTX pipeline
20. website
21. public entrant SDK
22. first real season
```

The biggest mistake now would be jumping to #18 because it is visually exciting.

The actual moat and magic lives in **#1–15**.

If those are real, LTX turns RoboBladez into a show.

If those are fake, LTX just makes a pretty AI animation.
